Package: scFlex
Type: Package
Title: Preservation-Aware Interoperability for Single-Cell Data Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohamed N.", "Hassan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "m.nhassan@hotmail.com")
    )
Description: Converts single-cell data among Seurat, SingleCellExperiment,
    AnnData, and Loom representations while preserving expression matrices,
    cell and feature metadata, and dimensional reductions when supported by
    the target format. Conversion is explicit about unsupported or missing
    components and performs alignment checks before writing output files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    methods,
    reticulate,
    SeuratObject
Suggests:
    hdf5r,
    Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/mohamednhassan/scFlex, https://mohamednhassan.github.io/scFlex/
BugReports: https://github.com/mohamednhassan/scFlex/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
